{
    "info": {
        "name": "CredVault — Team Vault API",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
        "description": "The Team Vault screen: the Team Details pane (admin card + department cards), one department (stats, level chips, hierarchy tree), View all (organisation), and the My Credentials / Team Credentials table.\n\nBEFORE YOU START\n1. Fill baseUrl, email/password (an employee with Credentials Vault → View), adminEmail/adminPassword (a client admin of the same company), managerEmail/managerPassword.\n2. Run 00 · Setup, then 01 · Team Vault in order: later requests read teamDeptId and teamMemberEmployeeId saved by earlier ones.\n\nFull details: docs/CREDVAULT_VAULTS_API_SHEET.md → Team Vault."
    },
    "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
            {
                "key": "token",
                "value": "{{token}}",
                "type": "string"
            }
        ]
    },
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "00 · Setup",
            "description": "Log in three people: the requester ({{token}}), the Vault Admin ({{adminToken}}) and the requester's reporting manager ({{managerToken}}). Then read the types and the two vaults.",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Login — requester (employee)",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "noauth"
                        },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "login"
                            ]
                        },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "const b = pm.response.json();",
                                    "if (b.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', b.token);",
                                    "pm.test('token stored', () => pm.expect(pm.collectionVariables.get('token')).to.not.eql(''));",
                                    "if (b.needs_org_selection) console.warn('This email exists in several companies — pick the org in the app first, or use a unique login.');"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Login — Vault Admin (client admin)",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "noauth"
                        },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "login"
                            ]
                        },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "const b = pm.response.json();",
                                    "if (b.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', b.token);",
                                    "pm.test('token stored', () => pm.expect(pm.collectionVariables.get('adminToken')).to.not.eql(''));",
                                    "if (b.needs_org_selection) console.warn('This email exists in several companies — pick the org in the app first, or use a unique login.');"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Login — requester's reporting manager",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "noauth"
                        },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "login"
                            ]
                        },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{managerEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{managerPassword}}\"\n}"
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "const b = pm.response.json();",
                                    "if (b.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('managerToken', b.token);",
                                    "pm.test('token stored', () => pm.expect(pm.collectionVariables.get('managerToken')).to.not.eql(''));",
                                    "if (b.needs_org_selection) console.warn('This email exists in several companies — pick the org in the app first, or use a unique login.');"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Meta — 25 types, vaults, 2-step methods",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/meta",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "meta"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                                    "pm.test('25 types', () => pm.expect(b.data.types.length).to.eql(25));",
                                    "pm.test('two vaults', () => pm.expect(b.data.vaults.map(v => v.prefix)).to.eql(['CRD', 'CCRD']));"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "01 · Team Vault — departments, hierarchy, team credentials",
            "description": "The Team Vault screen.\n\n• Left pane: GET /team/departments — the admin card (Vault Admin, members, departments, HODs, level bar) and one card per department (HOD name + initials, members, level bar, team credential counts).\n• Department view: GET /team/departments/{id} — stats (members, levels, teams), the level chips (Admin, HOD, TL, Executive, Employee, Intern), members (flat) and tree (Vault Admin → each person under their manager, with children_count and team_size on every node).\n• View all: GET /team/organisation — the same for every department, with a department node under the Admin.\n• The table: GET /normal-vault/credentials?tab=mine|team&department_id=&member_employee_id=&q=.",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Departments — admin card + department cards",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/team/departments",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "team",
                                "departments"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                                    "const b = pm.response.json();",
                                    "try { const v = b.data.departments[0].id; if (v !== undefined && v !== null) pm.collectionVariables.set('teamDeptId', String(v)); } catch (e) {}",
                                    "pm.test('admin card', () => { pm.expect(b.data.admin.admins[0].role).to.eql('Vault Administrator'); pm.expect(b.data.admin).to.include.keys('members', 'departments', 'hods', 'levels'); });",
                                    "pm.test('department cards', () => b.data.departments.forEach(d => pm.expect(d).to.include.keys('id', 'name', 'hod', 'members', 'levels', 'credentials', 'critical_credentials')));"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Departments — search",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/team/departments?q=a",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "team",
                                "departments"
                            ],
                            "query": [
                                {
                                    "key": "q",
                                    "value": "a"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "One department — stats, level chips, members, tree",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/team/departments/{{teamDeptId}}",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "team",
                                "departments",
                                "{{teamDeptId}}"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                                    "const b = pm.response.json();",
                                    "try { const v = b.data.members[0].employee_id; if (v !== undefined && v !== null) pm.collectionVariables.set('teamMemberEmployeeId', String(v)); } catch (e) {}",
                                    "pm.test('stats', () => pm.expect(b.data.stats).to.include.keys('members', 'levels', 'teams', 'hods', 'credentials'));",
                                    "pm.test('Admin chip first', () => pm.expect(b.data.levels[0].level).to.eql('admin'));",
                                    "pm.test('tree from the Vault Admin', () => { pm.expect(b.data.tree.type).to.eql('admin'); pm.expect(b.data.tree.children_count).to.eql(b.data.tree.children.length); });"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "One department — unknown (404)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/team/departments/999999",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "team",
                                "departments",
                                "999999"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Organisation — View all (every department)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/team/organisation",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "team",
                                "organisation"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                                    "pm.test('department nodes under the Admin', () => b.data.tree.children.forEach(c => pm.expect(c.type).to.eql('department')));"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Add a team credential (Team Vault)",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/normal-vault/credentials",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "normal-vault",
                                "credentials"
                            ]
                        },
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"type\": \"login\",\n    \"name\": \"GitHub Organisation {{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"scope\": \"team\",\n    \"fields\": {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/inorbvict\",\n        \"username\": \"devops@inorbvict.com\",\n        \"password\": \"G1thub!Org-2026#Strong\"\n    }\n}",
                            "options": {
                                "raw": {
                                    "language": "json"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "description": "No department_id: it goes to your own team. Send department_id only for your own team, or one you head or administer (any other → 403)."
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                                    "const b = pm.response.json();",
                                    "try { const v = b.data.id; if (v !== undefined && v !== null) pm.collectionVariables.set('teamCredId', String(v)); } catch (e) {}"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Table — My Credentials",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/credvault/normal-vault/credentials?tab=mine&page=1&per_page=10",
                            "host": [
                                "{{baseUrl}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "credvault",
                                "normal-vault",
                                "credentials"
                            ],
                            "query": [
                                {
                                    "key": "tab",
                                    "value": "mine"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "page",
                                    "value": "1"
                                },
                                {
                                    "key": "per_page",
                                    "value": "10"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Table — Team Credentials (one department)",
                    "request": {
